{"name":"Brainstorm","hex":"#d1d3c0","fetched":"2026-10-11","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"brainstorm","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To investigate something, or solve a problem using brainstorming.","To participate in a brainstorming session."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A sudden thought, particularly one that solves a long-standing problem.","A session of brainstorming, investigating a problem to try to find solutions."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/brainstorm"}],"entries":[{"title":"Brainstorm (1965 film)","blocks":[{"text":"Brainstorm is a 1965 neo-noir thriller film starring Jeffrey Hunter and Anne Francis. It was produced and directed by William Conrad, who was better known as an actor in radio, film, and such television series as Cannon and Jake and the Fatman, and was one of three suspense thrillers directed by Conrad for Warner Bros. Pictures in 1965, which also included Two on a Guillotine and My Blood Runs Cold."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/0/06/Brainstorm1965.jpg/330px-Brainstorm1965.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Brainstorm_(1965_film)"},{"title":"Brainstorm (1983 film)","blocks":[{"text":"Brainstorm is a 1983 American science fiction film directed by Douglas Trumbull, and starring Christopher Walken, Natalie Wood, Louise Fletcher, and Cliff Robertson."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/a/a6/Brainstorm_1983_poster.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Brainstorm_(1983_film)"},{"title":"Brainstorm (Latvian band)","blocks":[{"text":"Prāta Vētra, known internationally as Brainstorm, is a Latvian pop/rock band. The band became popular internationally in 2000 when they finished third in the Eurovision Song Contest 2000 with the song \"My Star\"."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c2/Brainstorm_on_tour_2008.JPG/330px-Brainstorm_on_tour_2008.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Brainstorm_(Latvian_band)"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f5/Natalie_Wood_on_set_of_Brainstorm_%281981%29.jpg/500px-Natalie_Wood_on_set_of_Brainstorm_%281981%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f5/Natalie_Wood_on_set_of_Brainstorm_%281981%29.jpg/1280px-Natalie_Wood_on_set_of_Brainstorm_%281981%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f5/Natalie_Wood_on_set_of_Brainstorm_%281981%29.jpg/500px-Natalie_Wood_on_set_of_Brainstorm_%281981%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Wood on the set of Brainstorm","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ANatalie_Wood_on_set_of_Brainstorm_(1981).jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/be/Brainstorm_in_Mezaparks.jpg/500px-Brainstorm_in_Mezaparks.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/be/Brainstorm_in_Mezaparks.jpg/500px-Brainstorm_in_Mezaparks.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Brainstorm at Mežaparks in 2008","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ABrainstorm_in_Mezaparks.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/eb/Brainstorm_2010_1.jpg/500px-Brainstorm_2010_1.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/eb/Brainstorm_2010_1.jpg/1280px-Brainstorm_2010_1.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/comm